            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Hangly 2.3</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Realistic ropes and chains.</strong> Every rope is drawn from real thread, leather,
      silk and metal, and chains hang a charm by their own last link.</li>
  <li><strong>Charms hang from their own rings.</strong> No gaps: the rope meets every charm, and
      ringed charms hang from a tiny jump ring.</li>
  <li><strong>Update in Background.</strong> When a new version is out, a card under the charm says
      what is new; one press and Hangly updates and restarts by itself.</li>
  <li><strong>News from the charm.</strong> New charms and collections pop up in glass under your
      charm, swing with it, and leave on their own.</li>
  <li><strong>A smoother Library</strong>, and a glow that takes each charm's own shape.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
